{"id":2765,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>岁序更迭，华章日新。为迎接元旦佳节，丰富校园文化生活，我院于2025年12月28日在科艺苑学术报告厅举办研究生元旦联欢晚会。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZnNUbDMR7aLzTfUE4QVMzlZnz7ZnmAe7UmCZMlrkn7linmv0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8M1y8okyDLz6kUzvanRNbMRUDLln2Ml-8U49aLzGaU4nFLR-bL4M7U4TFoRN4MSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/84648617BA70D994461DF5B4C80100C4/02933DC9/8935\" vheight=\"186.72999572753906\" vwidth=\"249.0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZnNUbDMR7aLzTfUE4QVMzlZnz7ZnmAe7UmCZMlrkn7linmv0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8M1y8okyDLz6kUzvanRNbMRUDLln2Ml-8U49aLzGaU4nFLR-bL4M7U4TFoRN4MSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>晚会在崔雅雲同学表演的舞蹈《如愿》中拉开序幕，柔美的舞姿与悠扬的旋律点燃全场氛围；随后，我院党委副书记李庆乐致辞，向同学们送上新年祝福，回顾学院一年来在学科建设、人才培养等方面取得的进展，并寄语各年级研究生学业进步、前程似锦。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZL47bPUlnknzrfLElCiLlr7MRGiMR9eYLRUaU47PU4UPMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDUSyDnkysM7LsLRfkolU4MNW2MN74nlUZoznVL7U4LmAFoRTRMlLbLzrFLmlbLzNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.png\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/66A6D74C700B9D36BF6A3ED894E0D328/89C5C915/25919\" vheight=\"185.8699951171875\" vwidth=\"247.8699951171875\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZL47bPUlnknzrfLElCiLlr7MRGiMR9eYLRUaU47PU4UPMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yDUSyDnkysM7LsLRfkolU4MNW2MN74nlUZoznVL7U4LmAFoRTRMlLbLzrFLmlbLzNJv2bjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.png\"></p><p>整场晚会节目形式多样、精彩纷呈。歌曲《别怕变老》《米店》《爱错》《Diamonds》轮番上演；小品《你的模样》《甄嬛传》幽默生动，引得掌声笑声不断；互动游戏环节同学们踊跃参与，舞蹈《你要跳舞吗》则以明快的节奏展现青春活力，将气氛推向高潮。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Znz9bsnNnknRL4ME7CYLz98n7U8UlLe8LNWVLmCiMR9ZUzU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2UYyDLSyDoRMVMlnkLllPMllio7VVLNnVnmvbMzMkLzrFnll4nm-8UlWFU8Q2U1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0FC61683E5DB1E15E58AE2DEF7953B15/EE3F24AB/CFFB\" vheight=\"199.1300048828125\" vwidth=\"265.5299987792969\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Znz9bsnNnknRL4ME7CYLz98n7U8UlLe8LNWVLmCiMR9ZUzU0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2UYyDLSyDoRMVMlnkLllPMllio7VVLNnVnmvbMzMkLzrFnll4nm-8UlWFU8Q2U1b/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>晚会接近尾声时，我院团委书记刘莉莉向全体演职人员表示感谢，并鼓励同学们在新的一年里平衡学习与生活，积极向上，在理论学习和实践中不断成长。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZLR-bYozMVMRn7UElVVU8U8Lmr2MRle4Mzv8nlUDUNnfo7-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkLYhVLSh2MlC4nNrVo77bLRARo7Vfnz-4nlVVM8UaM8WFLzLPnNWfL7MFUzT2okb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FB3E1F5F3FEE8A908C8AAE23EAE7D07B/131FBA0C/A9F8\" vheight=\"199.8000030517578\" vwidth=\"266.3999938964844\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZLR-bYozMVMRn7UElVVU8U8Lmr2MRle4Mzv8nlUDUNnfo7-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hkLYhVLSh2MlC4nNrVo77bLRARo7Vfnz-4nlVVM8UaM8WFLzLPnNWfL7MFUzT2okb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>本次晚会充分展现了马院学子的才华与风采，进一步增强了学院凝聚力。在新的一年中，同学们将继续保持这份热情与创造力，在学术与人生的舞台上，书写更加精彩的青春故事。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ZnNUbDMR7aLzTfUE4QVMzlZnz7ZnmAe7UmCZMlrkn7linmv0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8M1y8okyDLz6kUzvanRNbMRUDLln2Ml-8U49aLzGaU4nFLR-bL4M7U4TFoRN4MSb/v2rjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CPLRlJqdynx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6105&e=.jpeg"}